Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.33,0:00:03.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Insisting they belong to a fourth class,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the "Fourth" is a group that resorts to\Nindiscriminate acts of terror to attain their ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were attempting to spread a sketchy drug\Ncalled "monstrine" throughout the city of Libelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sent by Pastor Sicilia from the church,\NMomo and I started to investigate the drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo accidentally encountered Princess Ashuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who provided information on\Nthe monstrine's production facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, I set out to investigate the figurehead\Nof the Fourth in the city, Manon Libelle,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.29,0:00:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and infiltrated an evening ball hosted by her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But somehow,\NI ended up having to bring this nuisance along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.83,0:00:58.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:01:01.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a pure, just, and strong priestess!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Enjoying yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.63,0:01:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm a pure, just, and strong priestess!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Blessings to the both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.29,0:01:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, didn't I tell you not to stand out too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? I'm not standing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:22.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to at least introduce myself to the\Npeople I don't know or I'll seem odd!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:23.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if someone talks to you,\Nyou can't wander off with them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That, and don't have any of the food or drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no knowing what kind of suspicious\Ndrugs they might be laced with!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:37.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, you told me that like a hundred times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you take me for, Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.25,0:01:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think you're an idiot with the brain of a ten-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A couple of elegant women just told me,\N"My, what a lovely lady!" okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.17,0:01:55.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's me, a proper lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:58.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That kind of thing really makes me worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, I can't spend all my time worrying about Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, I'm going to excuse myself for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really? I'll be so lonely!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:14.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're a lady, you shouldn't whine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyway, wait for me like a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No moon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.46,0:02:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No divine protection from Saint Marta, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You there, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:14.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's a priestess like you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a careless guard for a place\Nthat produces monstrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:32.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get this over with and go\Nsavor the sight of Menou in a dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.08,0:04:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What I need to find is proof that Manon Libelle is involved\Nin the production and distribution of monstrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:52.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed, the manner in which you\Nconceal your presence is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:05:01.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Instead of hiding yourself,\Nyou keep yourself inconspicuous in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was so natural, even I almost failed to notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought there would be another soul\Nattempting to infiltrate the castle during the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently Manon Libelle has plenty of enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a princess of the Grisarika Kingdom and\Na knight in my own right, Ashuna Grisarika.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One of my maids neglected her duties\Nto come meet with her lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm simply here to admonish her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretending to be the daughter of an aristocrat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No lady of the Noblesse learns how to act in stealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If so, it would mean Your Highness couldn't\Nbe a lady of the Noblesse either,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:40.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,given that you detected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Order of Knights is an exception.\NStrength must be chosen over grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could it be you're of a similar ilk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why not turn around and show your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:06:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too shy to show your face, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I simply know my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I beseech you to turn a blind eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, seeing a suspicious character\Nmakes me want to cut them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's obvious from your\Nbearing that you're a skilled fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I prefer to scrutinize how strong\Na person is with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:22.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So you ask that I fight Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're quick on the uptake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.63,0:06:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suppose I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Etheric guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.13,0:06:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to be taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.17,0:06:58.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The terrorists on the train had them, too.\NWhere are you getting these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were watching, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.79,0:07:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A shot from that with your amount of\Nether will just ricochet off of my barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyway, why don't you show me\Nwhere your transaction records are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, and tell me about the etheric\Ntool producing monstrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll record it in my scripture.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're caught lying...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know what will happen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not interested in a fight, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm going to enjoy this either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Impressive judgement!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.17,0:07:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought I was faster but she anticipated it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're quite skilled at controlling ether.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then how about this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.25,0:08:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From what I can tell,\Nthis one doesn't have much etheric capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is no fun all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How much longer is Menou going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I sense magecraft being conjured! Something big!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:39.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bubbles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She used the bubbles as a diversion\Nwhile manipulating her dagger at will...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What smooth etheric control!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:08:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:09:02.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been ages since someone went\Neasy on me or outdid me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm touched!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm generous about repaying favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, I can't bear not seeing that face of yours,\Nwhatever that might take!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't compete with her technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:19.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So I'll win using my advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:35.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What's going on? I see flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.71,0:09:37.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the way Menou went.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:41.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's okay... right? It's Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's got to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:01.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, she got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To think she would get the better of me so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:14.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Except for Menou, you can all just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.83,0:10:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, so she's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's good material I can use\Nfor poking fun at Momo tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong. Something's definitely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.33,0:10:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The weird feeling I had back there is getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've regressed over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only major thing that's ever happened in Libelle\Nwas me getting sent into the Pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:47.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too many things are happening\Nthat have never happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Getting assaulted in the market,\Nthis ball being hosted, that pillar of fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,None of those have ever happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:56.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.46,0:11:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was such a large pillar of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Both of them seem rational so\NI'm sure there won't be much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you must excuse my sudden appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Manon Libelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:19.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do believe this is our first time meeting. Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This has never happened before, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:25.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her coming to talk to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly, could she be any more of a nuisance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's every bit the battle freak she's rumored to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That scuffle must have put the Fourth on alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a shame, but tonight's mission is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:58.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should meet up with Akari right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please don't be. I'm merely a proxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted a chance to meet with you briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My own mother had black hair just like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:33.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate if you could tell me about the\Nplace where you were before coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This person knows...\Nthat I'm an otherworlder who came from Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you rather not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:48.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's true. I've lost most of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The memories of my sixteen years in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That must mean you've also\Nused your powers quite heavily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I still envy you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have the thing that I long to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You possess the power to change the world...\Nas you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry to have bothered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:30.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you manage to get out of this city,\NI do hope you will be free to live as you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:34.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something is definitely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:37.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With this many new things happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,my advantage of knowing the\Nfuture won't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.79,0:13:45.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, I have to save Menou this time for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What to do? What to do? What to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:52.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh dear. What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:14:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, calm down Akari.\NMaybe this is a change for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Either way, I need to figure out\Nwhat's causing these big changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.67,0:14:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll look into that person who\Nseemed to know something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For starters, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.21,0:14:14.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What was the deal with those flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:16.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,How scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:19.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly. I told Akari to stay put!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to the transaction records,\Nthey started producing monstrine two weeks ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Manon Libelle, who had done nothing until that point,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,suddenly took initiative and brought in\Nthe etheric tool for producing monstrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.79,0:14:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder what could have happened two weeks ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The way this room is constructed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:15:02.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a typical ritual space based\Non the concept of original sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Which would mean,\Nthe center of the room should have a coffin-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:09.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not a coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An iron maiden?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a torture device.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I smell blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So this is the etheric tool used to produce monstrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What nasty taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:48.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They used... a child this little?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:16:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She probably won't make it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A conditional spell that activates\Nnot when you open the iron maiden,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but only when you try to save the child...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:22.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even worse, these spikes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Poison on the spikes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.38,0:16:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously, whoever set that up has\Na horribly twisted personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have to at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,contact... Me... nou...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:52.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With Miss Manon Libelle? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean that cute young priestess from before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:56.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were talking together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:17:01.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, it didn't look like it was a very lively conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.21,0:17:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it possible she was taken somewhere by Miss Manon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It didn't seem that way. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. Once she was alone, she said,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"What to do? What to do?"\Nand was making quite a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:13.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:15.58,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Then she wasn't kidnapped?\N{\rSubtitle-2}She was a cute girl but seemed a little "eccentric," don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:16.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,She was a cute girl but seemed a little "eccentric," don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:17.54,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Then where...?\N{\rSubtitle-2}She was a cute girl but seemed a little "eccentric," don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.88,0:17:24.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That trap was activated?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it's finally going to come.\NThe day I get my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.29,0:17:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me...nou...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't have to talk, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:18:00.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know everything that happened from the\Nrecordings you sent from your scripture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:02.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm... sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was a child... and I let my guard down...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You did a wonderful job, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud to have you as my aide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take your time and rest up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Leave the rest up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.67,0:18:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.71,0:18:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They've done it now, those Fourth bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:29.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was very strong poison and\Nshe's not in good condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:35.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the spread of the poison is slow,\Nperhaps thanks to her inherent reserve of ether.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe we can help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:43.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for your swift and pertinent response,\NPastor Sicilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No need to be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.13,0:18:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Providing protection to priestesses\Nis the duty of the Faust.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what of Ms. Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I failed to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems most likely that curiosity\Ntempted her to explore the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.71,0:18:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,where she must have gotten lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:19:01.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Either that or the Fourth have her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:04.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They didn't seem to have any interest in Akari...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But of course that is a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:11.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As such, Pastor Sicilia,\Ncan I ask you to close off Libelle Castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo's video recording has made it clear that\Nthe Fourth are involved in the production of monstrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:23.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let us completely weed out the Fourth based in Libelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I will invade the castle and capture\NManon Libelle and the leading members.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And recover Akari, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could I ask you to negotiate for the\NOrder of Knights to cooperate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You rely on others, unlike Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're familiar with my Master, Pastor Sicilia?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She told me once to my face...\Nthat I was useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've met you before as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.67,0:20:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But of course you wouldn't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.75,0:20:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, Ms. Menou. Didn't you suspect me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That I might have a hand in what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:15.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would be a lie to say I never suspected you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Especially since it's right after what\Nhappened with Archbishop Orwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.83,0:20:20.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm proposing this plan because I've determined\Nthat you're trustworthy based on our interactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pastor Sicilia, please give me the help I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I shall go negotiate with the Order of Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:45.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Libelle Island has been sequestered as of noon today!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:50.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All Fourth lurking on the island will be arrested\Nfor the production and distribution of monstrine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All who wish to plead guilty must surrender immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.79,0:20:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I repeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.29,0:20:58.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Libelle Island has been sequestered as of noon today!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:02.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All Fourth lurking on the island will be arrested\Nfor the production and distribution of monstrine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-who thought they would act so quickly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.17,0:21:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.17,0:21:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C-calm yourself. They haven't arrested us yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:11.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You are completely surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.71,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,This is unfortunate...\N{\rSubtitle-2}You are completely surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:13.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Do not resist and surrender immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.25,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should make sure\N{\rSubtitle-2}Do not resist and surrender immediately!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:18.00,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,the members won't talk, for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.83,0:21:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did somebody touch this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.63,0:21:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to keep you waiting.\NLet us discuss how to counter-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.67,0:21:47.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My, it's amazing that you can do such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it was you who snuck into my room as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.13,0:21:54.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello again, Miss Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:22:00.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you a few things, but do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bid you welcome, Miss Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.17,0:23:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next episode: The Daughter of a Lost One.
